WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
The adoption barriers are
broader than model capability.

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.840
The industry survey highlights privacy,

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.960
integration complexity,
reliability and skill gaps.

00:00:09.093 --> 00:00:13.920
These are overlapping responses, so
the bars are not slices of a single total.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.400
For leadership, the implication is
practical: budget for integration,

00:00:18.444 --> 00:00:21.880
reviewer capacity and learning
alongside the tool.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.120
A successful demonstration does
not remove the organizational

00:00:25.168 --> 00:00:28.000
work needed to operate
the capability consistently.
